{
  "name": "Basic Lead Form → Google Meet Booking",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Lead → Meeting Booking (2-page form)\n**Page 1:** customer details + date.\n**Page 2:** only the FREE times for that date are shown (booked times never appear).\nThen: recheck → Google Calendar event + Google Meet → customer & admin emails → Google Sheet.\n\n**Setup:** Google Calendar credential (3 nodes), Google Sheets credential + pick your sheet (2 nodes). Sheet tab `Leads`, row 1 headers:\n`Submitted At | Name | Email | Phone | Company | Service | Message | Meeting Date | Meeting Time | Status | Google Meet Link`\nThen **Publish**. Form link: `/form/book-meeting`",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "c7ddb0ed-165c-4567-9b9d-240146e72507",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -420
      ]
    },
